<!--Vivicore-->

	<ThingDef ParentName="BaseWildTerraweapon">
		<defName>ET_HybridRoyalRifle</defName>		<!--Counterpart: Prima AR, with penalties of minus 2 -->
		<label>vivicore rifle</label>
		<description>The vivicore rifle is a weapon masterfully shaped from the rare and elusive vivicore tree, a special tree that grows a thick bark on the outside, and a vibrant, beautiful crystal beneath it. While the bark itself is quite durable, the crystal within is quite fragile, making it ill-suited for combat.
\nThe damage potential of this weapon is relatively low, only on par with some prima weapons. It is best appreciated as a work of art, or a sign of status. It is comparable to a sword made of solid gold: quite valuable and technically functional, but vastly inferior to other swords for it's intended purpose.
\n\nDue to it's hybrid nature, this weapon can be quickly rejuvinated with shocksap or shockshards, like any other lithoid weapon. Alternatively, it can also be planted in the ground to be rejuvinated as an organic weapon. One is a matter of resources, while the other is a matter of time.
\nThis rifle has no innate sap or other infusion ability. Additionally, it was not shaped with combat in mind, making it's form completely immutable.</description>
